{"4827960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BLACK WALLS", "steam_appid": 4827960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/00d85e40f12f6cbb2f86eff6c12c4a8e.avif?t=1788054031\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BLACK WALLS is a first-person surreal puzzle horror game with liminal and psychological horror elements. It is about an isolated astronaut who discovers something impossible beyond the Moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joshua should have died alone in the darkness. An accident outside the space station sent him drifting into deep space, farther and farther from any hope of rescue. Then, beyond the far side of the Moon, where there should have been nothing, he saw something impossible: <strong>black walls.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They offered a way in, but no way out. Now trapped inside this silent, impossible world, Joshua must solve its strange puzzles and overcome its obstacles as he searches for an escape and begins to uncover what the Black Walls really are.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/4cd59fb0671ac6ed47e43188557e1c3e.avif?t=1788054031\" alt=\"\"width=780 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/3f457ef4c9d3c7bb4169382b1e21bbae.avif?t=1788054031\" alt=\"The Black Maze\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/e5d99c59fc88ce9a344c50e0f52150a3.poster.avif?t=1788054031\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/e5d99c59fc88ce9a344c50e0f52150a3.webm?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/e5d99c59fc88ce9a344c50e0f52150a3.mp4?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built from monochrome spaces, brutal geometry, and stark light. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/68140644cdbf4133c4e93d43b28df477.avif?t=1788054031\" alt=\"Read The Light\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/ca3f0bb598c451daca2fb2e992f4e78f.poster.avif?t=1788054031\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/ca3f0bb598c451daca2fb2e992f4e78f.webm?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/ca3f0bb598c451daca2fb2e992f4e78f.mp4?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study how light changes what you can see, read the space around you, and notice where darkness hides paths that may already be in front of you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/364dcf55cdd9bca81162b50ff2e47b91.avif?t=1788054031\" alt=\"Quiet Unease\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/9269539b75a39def03258b1d2ce24eee.poster.avif?t=1788054031\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/9269539b75a39def03258b1d2ce24eee.webm?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/9269539b75a39def03258b1d2ce24eee.mp4?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where silence, spatial sound, and minimal interface elements keep the focus on presence and unease. Some areas </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >feel calm and almost peaceful. Others feel wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/29208b3d10997388e2e1297a447a179f.avif?t=1788054031\" alt=\"Symbolic Choices\" width=780 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/b5584c3b89b685ddcac0486d0579fabd.poster.avif?t=1788054031\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/b5584c3b89b685ddcac0486d0579fabd.webm?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/b5584c3b89b685ddcac0486d0579fabd.mp4?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully interpret objects you discover in the maze. The choices you make will shape your ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/62be7b6efc8202cf418d4a5852400801.avif?t=1788054031\" alt=\"Chill Mode\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/0ef5eeee553aca763b3ea1baf2fe447a.poster.avif?t=1788054031\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/0ef5eeee553aca763b3ea1baf2fe447a.webm?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/0ef5eeee553aca763b3ea1baf2fe447a.mp4?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore at your own pace, focusing on atmosphere, direction-finding, and discovery without a monster hunting you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/73acf6d1a51ff73bf1eae1a5d08c42db.avif?t=1788054031\" alt=\"Horror Mode\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/9d3e5194615b5441ce7c1c6f99b941e6.poster.avif?t=1788054031\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/9d3e5194615b5441ce7c1c6f99b941e6.webm?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/9d3e5194615b5441ce7c1c6f99b941e6.mp4?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For survival horror tension with an unpredictable threat that can appear in different places and moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/571875731f5f588c9b897ee46fa4a7e0.avif?t=1788054031\" alt=\"Story in Silence\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/7d197c10a3f47f95a2acb9969db7e96e.poster.avif?t=1788054031\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/7d197c10a3f47f95a2acb9969db7e96e.webm?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/7d197c10a3f47f95a2acb9969db7e96e.mp4?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than direct exposition, <strong>BLACK WALLS</strong> tells its story through architecture, symbols, atmosphere, and the decisions you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste