ent places and moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/571875731f5f588c9b897ee46fa4a7e0.avif?t=1788054031\" alt=\"Story in Silence\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/7d197c10a3f47f95a2acb9969db7e96e.poster.avif?t=1788054031\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/7d197c10a3f47f95a2acb9969db7e96e.webm?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/extras/7d197c10a3f47f95a2acb9969db7e96e.mp4?t=1788054031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than direct exposition, <strong>BLACK WALLS</strong> tells its story through architecture, symbols, atmosphere, and the decisions you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Explore a silent, impossible world of puzzles and obstacles. Make symbolic choices whose consequences may not be clear, your decisions shape your ending. Choose Chill Mode for a calm, mysterious journey with nothing hunting you, or Horror Mode for fear, danger, and something that wants you dead.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, Italian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827960/15887174491b14bb37182f6cff5d07aa32f5440